(7369401, 1154946, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simple, atmospheric and charming rendition of an old time sci-fi movie.  Perfect time of day for a picturesque abduction. The blue-purple is lovely.</td>', 'Simple, atmospheric and charming rendition of an old time sci-fi movie.  Perfect time of day for a picturesque abduction. The blue-purple is lovely.', '2015-06-22 11:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369433, 1154779, 173844, '<td valign="top">Without the car this is a pleasing landscape.  Adding it sailing over the crest, along with the terrific title, lifts the image way up into whimsy, fun, humor and charm.  There are many fine photos in this challenge, but this is the one that really made me smile.  The blues and yellows and the dab of red, and the clouds, are a very comfortable combination.  I wish I were out standing on the roadside.</td>', 'Without the car this is a pleasing landscape.  Adding it sailing over the crest, along with the terrific title, lifts the image way up into whimsy, fun, humor and charm.  There are many fine photos in this challenge, but this is the one that really made me smile.  The blues and yellows and the dab of red, and the clouds, are a very comfortable combination.  I wish I were out standing on the roadside.', '2015-06-22 11:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369455, 1153770, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, crisp image.  The design seems to be etched on convex blue glass petals.  Soothingly hypnotic.</td>', 'Lovely, crisp image.  The design seems to be etched on convex blue glass petals.  Soothingly hypnotic.', '2015-06-22 12:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369459, 1154834, 173844, '<td valign="top">A detail that works wonderfully as a full, wide-angle image.  The light on the tree top is the glorious light that surrounds a storm, as seen reflected in the background.  The sky has the feel of Tiffany glass.  Good composition.  Nice.</td>', 'A detail that works wonderfully as a full, wide-angle image.  The light on the tree top is the glorious light that surrounds a storm, as seen reflected in the background.  The sky has the feel of Tiffany glass.  Good composition.  Nice.', '2015-06-22 12:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
