(7372642, 1154790, 115814, '<td valign="top">This is for you...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1157041" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1157041.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1157041.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1157041.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>A new bit of personalized bling from someone uniquely unqualified to make artiistic judgements. That said...<br/> <br/><i>This is remarkable. It''s ascending; it''s submerged; it''s flying; it''s abstract and not. This is definately not the real world. You get the first ever, BTC Blue. Appropriate that it should be awarded in a challenge of the same name. </i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-06-26 00:45:40.</i></td>', 'This is for you...   A new bit of personalized bling from someone uniquely unqualified to make artiistic judgements. That said... This is remarkable. It''s ascending; it''s submerged; it''s flying; it''s abstract and not. This is definately not the real world. You get the first ever, BTC Blue. Appropriate that it should be awarded in a challenge of the same name. ', '2015-06-25 13:11:13.000000', '2015-06-26 01:45:40.000000', 1),
(7372644, 1154727, 115814, '<td valign="top">This caught me attention right away. I been returning to look and try to understand why. I suspect the contrasts of color and texture are a significant reason. There''s also the contrast of horizontal repetitions with vertical lines. Enough analysis - it''s a very effective entry. Here''s some bling to go with it.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153350" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This caught me attention right away. I been returning to look and try to understand why. I suspect the contrasts of color and texture are a significant reason. There''s also the contrast of horizontal repetitions with vertical lines. Enough analysis - it''s a very effective entry. Here''s some bling to go with it.', '2015-06-25 13:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
