(7373020, 1154435, 83149, '<td valign="top">The man''s face looks a little off, but everything else is just great.  Love the idea and the work with the light and fish is fantastic.</td>', 'The man''s face looks a little off, but everything else is just great.  Love the idea and the work with the light and fish is fantastic.', '2015-06-26 00:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373022, 1154939, 83149, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot, but I think you are going to suffer some on the colour.  The Turqoise has a lot of green.</td>', 'It''s a great shot, but I think you are going to suffer some on the colour.  The Turqoise has a lot of green.', '2015-06-26 00:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373026, 1154811, 94815, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot, but the excessive negative space diminishes the impact and focus on the woman. I also like the shadowy tones of the background; so I would keep the right half of the image and crop out the left. But what do I know. 6 as is.</td>', 'Really like this shot, but the excessive negative space diminishes the impact and focus on the woman. I also like the shadowy tones of the background; so I would keep the right half of the image and crop out the left. But what do I know. 6 as is.', '2015-06-26 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373027, 1154005, 83149, '<td valign="top">Let me start by saying this is a fantastic idea.  I love it.  Unfortunately, the execution doesn''t do it justice.  The mom is out of focus and the tops of curtains really take away from the image.  The pattern on the curtain is kind of distracting as well.  On the plus side, the lighting is good, and both your models did an excellent job.  Mom''s expression is perfect, as is the way the toddler is pulling the curtains.</td>', 'Let me start by saying this is a fantastic idea.  I love it.  Unfortunately, the execution doesn''t do it justice.  The mom is out of focus and the tops of curtains really take away from the image.  The pattern on the curtain is kind of distracting as well.  On the plus side, the lighting is good, and both your models did an excellent job.  Mom''s expression is perfect, as is the way the toddler is pulling the curtains.', '2015-06-26 00:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373044, 1154550, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very graceful bumping up.</td>', 'Very graceful bumping up.', '2015-06-26 00:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373062, 1154949, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hints?  Can you let us know how you put this together?  I''ve tried a number of times and mine never have a smooth sphere in the center... and how did you get the person in there?  Quite fascinating!</td>', 'Hints?  Can you let us know how you put this together?  I''ve tried a number of times and mine never have a smooth sphere in the center... and how did you get the person in there?  Quite fascinating!', '2015-06-26 01:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
