(7373070, 1154648, 62357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SEG:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this image. Very simply. I would have liked it better without the window in the shot though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>ha.  No, really not.  Good we all have different points of view.  The window is the icing on the cake :)  Well done on the bling.</td>', 'Originally posted by SEG: I like this image. Very simply. I would have liked it better without the window in the shot though.  ha.  No, really not.  Good we all have different points of view.  The window is the icing on the cake :)  Well done on the bling.', '2015-06-26 01:10:42.000000', NULL, 0),
