(7373716, 1154949, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>I''ve always been fascinated with these shots. However I have never been able to successfully make one. Everything in this shot is crisp and clear. I like the look of the sky, clouds, and bridge. Overall I would say that you did an excellent job at pulling this one off. Your score also reflects that. Good job and happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... I''ve always been fascinated with these shots. However I have never been able to successfully make one. Everything in this shot is crisp and clear. I like the look of the sky, clouds, and bridge. Overall I would say that you did an excellent job at pulling this one off. Your score also reflects that. Good job and happy shooting', '2015-06-26 15:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373744, 1154056, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>1st of all I want to say I love the sky.... The main thing that really catches my eye in a negative way is the motion blur. On his wing I can see blur. I think this hurt you in the long run. Unfortunately on this one I do agree with the score. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... 1st of all I want to say I love the sky.... The main thing that really catches my eye in a negative way is the motion blur. On his wing I can see blur. I think this hurt you in the long run. Unfortunately on this one I do agree with the score. Happy shooting', '2015-06-26 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
