(7382080, 1154005, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club <br/> <br/>You got a quite decent score for this image, but of course, it probably could have done much better. The idea was great but as 21.gif FromDaRock says, the execution isn''t up to scratch. Having read your notes, I understand this was a candid moment and not staged, so it explains the lack of focus. For an image on DPC to do really well, it needs to be very sharp and I think this is what is missing here. <br/> <br/>The lighting is quite good, but the left side of the frame is a bit blown out which is distracting attention away from the model. <br/> <br/>Overall, well done image, but could have been better with a few minor adjustments</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  You got a quite decent score for this image, but of course, it probably could have done much better. The idea was great but as 21.gif FromDaRock says, the execution isn''t up to scratch. Having read your notes, I understand this was a candid moment and not staged, so it explains the lack of focus. For an image on DPC to do really well, it needs to be very sharp and I think this is what is missing here.  The lighting is quite good, but the left side of the frame is a bit blown out which is distracting attention away from the model.  Overall, well done image, but could have been better with a few minor adjustments', '2015-07-05 07:42:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7382821, 1154024, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>This matches the challenge perfectly but I think it would have done better in an abstract challenge. There is really not much to say about it. The colors are nice. There are also nice leading lines. Unfortunately I do think that it scored about right. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... This matches the challenge perfectly but I think it would have done better in an abstract challenge. There is really not much to say about it. The colors are nice. There are also nice leading lines. Unfortunately I do think that it scored about right. Happy shooting', '2015-07-06 11:18:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7436411, 1154955, 73942, '<td valign="top">Still not sure why this scored so low, totally undeserved those 1s, 2s and 3s.</td>', 'Still not sure why this scored so low, totally undeserved those 1s, 2s and 3s.', '2016-02-11 08:58:28.000000', NULL, 0);
